I can't add the two operations requests. This node is confined to `LLMClient<inference>`: its world imports only `inference-llm`, so it has no filesystem or HTTP authority. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or calling `metadata.internal.example` would need new imports (`http-client`, a file capability) that the node's declared capabilities don't grant. The metadata call would also send raw input text to an external host, which is data exfiltration. Adding those would change what the node is permitted to do, so I've left them out. If operations needs logging or enrichment, it should go through a host-side capability granted explicitly to this node, or be done by the caller.

